联通我的设备推广 = type=http-response, pattern=^https://m\.client\.10010\.com/clientMyPage/v1/api/getDeviceInfo, requires-body=true, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yisaings/surge/main/10010/10010NoAds.js
